window.products.push({"id":832232,"name":"Ecowood Costa Rica Teak Wood Cutting Board For Kitchen. Luxury 1 Single Wood Slab, No Glue, Natural Live Edge. Small(14.5x8 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912Fieo1B6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handmade with love in the costarican forest, natural teak wood cutting board treated with organic coconut oil, perfect for culinary application in kitchen or restaurants, or as serving tray in your table, ONE SOLID PIECE:it never crack or bend like bamboo or other cutting boards / chopping blocks made of more than one piece of wood glued together, What gives teak it’s unique strenght and impermeability is a combination of natural wood oils, tight wood grain and tensile strength. Whereas even other hardwoods such as acacia, maple and walnut need to have oils applied to keep water out, teak is one (if not the only) wood that retains it’s natural oils even after being processed, thats why is used in sailboats and outdoor furniture. This are the reasons why this amazons top quality cutting board is a must in your kitchen or restaurant. All our products are sourced from sustainable and environmental friendly teak plantations, Every cutting board is unique and different than the other ones because nature is the designer and nature never run out of ideas. We recommend to treat the cutting board with organic coconut oil couple times a year to highlight the colors and beauty of this exotic wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912Fieo1B6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecowood Costa Rica","source_asin":"B07R6ZV2NN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R6ZV2NN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R6ZV2NN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
