window.products.push({"id":832243,"name":"Victoria 10-Inch Commercial-Grade Cast-Iron Tortilla Press, Made from Super-Durable HD Iron, Made in Colombia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWAVtkDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAST-IRON TORTILLA MAKER: Our high-quality cast-iron press and quesadilla maker is seasoned with non-GMO, kosher-certified flaxseed oil, and it’s PTFE- and PFOA-free for healthier tortillas. Give your cooking an upgrade by using cast-iron cookware. DURABLE TORTILLA & BURRITO MAKER: Our cast-iron tortilla press was designed with the user in mind. It’s made with indestructible HD iron, a reinforced design with engineered plates that avoid pinching, and an improved base and handle for better resistance. EASY TO USE: With this tortilla presser, you can make homemade flour, corn, gluten-free, paleo, and wheat tortillas! For wheat tortillas, see our website for recipes and tips. You can also use it as a roti maker or to make quesadillas, empanadas, arepas, patacones, tostones, and more. SMALL OR LARGE TORTILLA PRESS: Our cast-iron tortilla press is made with natural materials and is easy to maintain. It’s available in multiple sizes, and each press comes with an extra screw for the lever to ensure perfect tortillas every time. QUALITY CAST-IRON COOKWARE: Victoria has manufactured quality cast-iron cookware in our own factories in Colombia—never outsourcing—since 1939. Our cast-iron products are made with resource-efficient materials, are economical, outlast traditional cookware, and offer reliable cooking for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWAVtkDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victoria","source_asin":"B0742T8LRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0742T8LRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0742T8LRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832244,"name":"6-Shelf Over Door Hanging Organizer, Extra Large Sturdy Over Door Organizer with 12 Spaces, Foldable Back of Door Storage Organizer for Nursery Baby C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KTJmqdeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120g Nylon non-woven fabric, High-density Sturdy 3 MM PP Board 【LARGE CAPACITY with 5-SHELF WINDOW POCKETS & 4 Mesh SIDE POCKETS & 3 PVC POCKETS】UPGRADED door hanging organizers is divided into three areas. PVC pockets is great for any bottles/lotions of different size. Side pockets can easily store small toys, handbags and other items. Window pockets is bigger than others in the market and can clearly see what is stored inside 【100% HEALTH and DURABLE MATERIAL, NO CHEMICAL SMELL】Closet door organizer is made of 120g nylon non-woven fabric, which is enough to withstand daily wear and tear, and resistant to tearing, fraying and fading, and easy to clean with just a wet wipe. High-density 3 MM PP board on each side of the door hanging shelf are strong and durable enough to support the entire hanging organizer to ensure years of use 【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL HANGING STORAGE ORGANIZER】Door organizer is perfect for baby, children, teens, and adults. Behind door organizer can store baby cloths, diaper, toys, bottles,  cosmetics, slippers, scarves, hats, towels, kids colorful books, toddler shoes, cosmetics, snack pantry foods, shower gel, art supplies, kitchen supplies and other items 【DIMENSIONS & WEIGHT CAPACITY & EASY TO ASSEMBLE】Door hanging organizers measure 59\" H X 14.1\" L X 5.9\" W (150 X 36 X 15 CM). Each pocket is 7.4\" H X 14.1\" L X 5.9\" W.(19 X 36 X 15 CM ). In addition, the hook is 3.9\" H X 2.05\" W, which is perfect for 2\" thick door. High-strength materials ensure a 30 LBS weight capacity. hibobi closet door organizer comes with professional installation manual, which can help you finish it within 3 minutes 【100% SATISFIED CUSTOMER SERVICE】 WARM TIPS: Please confirm the distance between the door and floor before buying, or contact us. We will offer 1 year / 12 months warranty. Not Satisfied, Get a Full Refund. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. We will provide you with prompt and friendly service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KTJmqdeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hibobi","source_asin":"B09H6TLRF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H6TLRF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H6TLRF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
