window.products.push({"id":832257,"name":"4 IN 1 Portable Air Conditioner - 75°Oscillating Evaporative Air Cooler with 4 Speeds Rainbow LED Light, 2 Spray Humidify & 2-6H Timer, Super Quiet Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZevQAGiHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WANT TO STAY COOL AND FRESH ON A HOT, SWEATY SUMMER DAY? ❅Our portable air conditioner fans save you money and blow cool wind, keep your skin hydrated and enjoy fresh air, quiet and easy to carry. ❅Powerful, compact, portable air cooler with 4 levels of wind, 2 Refrigeration, clean, comfortable air! It uses the same ultrasonic atomizer and nano-spray technology as the face steamer to effectively reduce dryness. Frequnent Q&A #Q: Does the air cooler wet my desk? The water drawer and sponge are designed for collecting the mist water so that you do not have to worry about the water leak everywhere. You could open the water drawer and take out the sponge to wash it after your every use. #Q: Can it achieve the same cooling effect as an air conditioner? It's only for personal use which only cool for small space. Please use it close. #Q: Why sometimes it cools weakly? The type of adapter and water has a great influence on the cooling effect. Do not use pure water or distilled water, juse use tap water. Use a 5V/2A adapter to ensure that the machine has enough power to work. #Q: How long does the water in the tank last before it needs replacing?Can it work without water? 600 ml water tank makes the air cooling fan work for 8-10 hours.When the water is used up, the spray function will automatically turn off,will change to the natural wind. Even if the water runs out, it can still work, #Q: What can I do if I have trouble on using it or I'm not satisfied with the personal air cooler? Please feel free to contact us, we will give you a satisfactory solution program. THE PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 x Personal Air Conditioning Fan 1 x USB cable 1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZevQAGiHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOSTIN","source_asin":"B0B1YD813Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1YD813Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1YD813Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832258,"name":"Andaz Press Personalized Bridal Hangers, Premium White Wooden Hangers for Wedding Dress, Bridesmaid Dresses, Bridal Party, Custom Name Wedding Gift, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zlbZnJqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED HANGERS FOR WEDDING: After that long search for your dream wedding dress, you wouldn't want to display it on cheap-looking wedding hangers. Complement your white dress with our personalized chic wedding dress hanger. Choose from 5 font styles to personalized hangers for wedding dresses, bridal shower dresses for bride, wedding garters for bride, bridal party shirts, maid of honor, flower girl, and bridesmaid dresses. FOR THE BIG DAY AND BEYOND: Made of premium solid wood that is incredibly durable, our personalized wedding hangers can withstand the weight of heavy garments such as suits and coats. After the big day, this bride's hanger is a keepsake that you'll have in your closet for years to come. TOP NOTCH HANGERS: Boasting smoothly cut notches, this bridal dress hanger also doubles as a tank top hanger that lets you keep your strappy shirts and dresses in shape. Unlike other hangers, our wedding personalized hanger features a 360° gold swivel hook that allows you to hang clothing from any angle and check out garments with ease. CHIC PERSONALIZED STYLE: With your choice of customized name design, this bride hanger wedding dress can be customized especially for you and your bridal party. Each hanger is well-sanded and crafted with an elegant finish that will look lovely in and out of your closet. A GIFT THAT WON'T LEAVE YOU HANGING: Decorated with a timeless white hangers wood design, our bride hanger for wedding dress makes a great wedding hanger personalized gift. Can be used as a personalized hanger for baptism, bridal gifts for the bride personalized, baby clothes hangers, coat hangers for the closet, hangers for skirts, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zlbZnJqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B0B1841FKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1841FKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1841FKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
