window.products.push({"id":832275,"name":"Rusticity® Wooden Serving Bowl - Brass | Handmade | (7in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7162Tpbd5oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is never too early nor too late to renovate your kitchen, and there can be nothing better and trendier than including some rustic items in your kitchenware collection. Rusticity’s Wood Serving Bowls are handcrafted out of a single block of wood by traditional artisans from rural India using skilled techniques for the correct amount of ornateness. These are perfectly safe for any edible product, and the rustic wood finish and intricate carvings make for a stylish gift on birthdays, festive occasions, etc. for children and adults alike. Caution : Dry food items preferred. Not to be immersed in liquid/water for elongated periods of time. Rusticity stands for the quality of being rustic. We are an international brand of traditional products which have been handcrafted for modern use. Our products are created to add a traditional rustic flavour to your lives, while at the same time, being of modern utility and value. All our products are sourced from traditional artisans from Indian villages who have been in the handcrafting profession for a long time. We acquire all items in a fair and responsible manner and provide some highly needed support to these traditional arts and crafts that are facing a daily struggle to survive in the wake of a globalised mechanised world. *Since these are handcrafted, each individual unit may vary slightly from each other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7162Tpbd5oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B01M060P7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M060P7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M060P7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832276,"name":"Redrock Traditions Hear Our Prayers Vintage White 6 x 20 Pallet Wood Style Keyholder Sign Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gNECoq+DL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Life is busy, and it’s easy to allow a day, a week, or a month go by without much real family conversation or connection. Red Rock Traditions is continuously trying to think of ways to knit family closer together, not only during planned vacations, but every day. We are often looking for solutions to make the most of our together-time and to create a bedrock of memories, shared stories, conversations and laughter. Red Rock Traditions is dedicated to strengthening the bonds of family and friends through products that are meaningful. Wall art and signs from Red Rock Collection are more than decorative as they double as reminders of what is most important, family connection. As the saying goes...families that pray together stay together. Learn how to pray more meaningfully by inviting prayers of Adoration, Confession, Thankfulness, and Supplication (ACTS). Alternatively, devote a hook to each family member to offer special intentions. Bring antique charm to your decorating spaces with this home accent. Pretty antique inspired hooks with metal plated labels hold family and friend prayers on feather shaped cards. Set includes 100 angel wing papers with newspaper print design. Board sentiment reads, “Hear Our Prayers.” Made of wood composite material and overall dimensions measure 6 x 20 inches. Pallet style craftsmanship is finished with a distressed white detail and coordinates in any room of your home. Make a thoughtful housewarming gift. Part of the Faith Collection for DEMDACO. Wooden marbles included in set. Ships all together within protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gNECoq+DL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Redrock Traditions","source_asin":"B07H3B1J62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H3B1J62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H3B1J62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
