window.products.push({"id":832351,"name":"Tree of Life Wall Art, Tree Life Metal Wall Decor, 11.8 Inches Round Tree Metal Wall Hanging, Family Tree Wall Decor, Circle Metal Tree Wall Art for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fii+3nh9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀ Impressive Metal Wall Art - Tree of life wall decor is beautifully designed, and the surface is sprayed with antique black colored anti-rust paint for a more exquisite appearance. With a tree as the center, every leaf is vivid and lovely. The roots of the tree form a circle with 2 rings on the edge, and it is hung by a rope with wooden beads. Whenever the sun shines through the window, this stained metal art will be amazing. ☀ Metal Wall Hanging - Metal hanging art is made of iron, which is strong and durable, not easy to break, fade and corrode. It measures 11.8 inches in diameter and weighs 0.55 pounds. Tree wall decor can hold its color and shape for a long time, adding a pop of color to your home. ☀ Widely Used Occasion - Tree of life metal wall art can be used to decorate your living room, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom, laundry, garden, backyard and more. You can hang it on walls, doors, TV backdrops, cabinets, shelves, fireplaces, in the hallway or anywhere you like to make your walls look perfect and give you an instant touch of outdoor flair. ☀ Easy to Hang - The tree of life wall sculpture comes with a beaded rope hanger, making it easier to hang this decorative tree wall art. You can hang it on the wall with just 1 nail, or you can hang it on a branch or garden stand. Maybe you can hang it in other places to play a peculiar decorative effect, let's start your creativity! ☀ Best Gift Idea - This modern style metal wall decor is suitable for all occasions and can be used as an anniversary gift, housewarming gift, birthday gift, spring gift for your friends, family and kids. Send warm greetings to their home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fii+3nh9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aifeorzo","source_asin":"B0BP9XYBTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP9XYBTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP9XYBTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832352,"name":"Glass Straws,12-Pack Reusable Glass Drinking Straws, Size 8.5''x10 MM, Including 6 Straight and 6 Bent with 2 Cleaning Brush, Clear Glass Straws Reusa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IJnG1nG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT INCLUDE: 6 Pcs straight glass straws + 6 pcs bent glass straws + 2 pcs straw brushes. There is also a very nice glass straw gift box. ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION: Traditional plastic straws exposed to high temperature may produce carcinogens, but glass straws do not have this problem. At the same time, the reusable glass straws avoid the non-degradable waste brought by plastic straws and protect the ecology. BETTER QUALITY GLASS STRAWS: Glass straws are made of high-quality borosilicate glass, which is thicker, stronger, and more resistant to drops than ordinary glass straws. The upgraded process makes the glass straw feel smoother and has no burrs on the edge, making it more secure to use. GLASS STRAWS DRINKING REUSABLE:The used glass straws can be washed with water or in the dishwasher, and can be reused as long as they are not broken. These clear straws are made of food grade borosilicate glass, tasteless and BPA free, your drinks will not have a metallic taste. CLEAR GLASS STRAWS ARE RESISTANT TO PRESSURE: Our smoothie straws glass are resistant to high and low temperatures, so you can enjoy a variety of tastes, hot or cold. Perfect for drinking hot/cold beverages, water, bubble tea, smoothies, milkshakes, coffee, milk and cocktails etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IJnG1nG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BHYTAKI","source_asin":"B09TKXG87X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKXG87X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKXG87X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
