window.products.push({"id":832385,"name":"AZHCHKE Toilet Seat Cover Pads 3 Pack - Thicker Soft Bathroom Warmer Handle Toilet Seat Cover Pad, Stretchable Washable and Easy Installation Cushione","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZcfIltOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our toilet seat cushion is made of quality polyester, themselves flexible can be used in all seasons. Package Included: 3 x Toilet Seat Cover Pads with Handle Fits most toilet seats (14\" x 18\") Tips: Does not fit（More than 18\"）elongated toilet seats! Features: 1. Upgraded thicker design, thick and soft, high elasticity, warm and comfortable. 2. Easy to fit and remove. 3. Can be machine washed in a laundry bag or hand washed. 4. with handle lid-lifting, More sanitary and convenient. 5. four colors for you to change and wash. Note: Before cleaning, please remove the plastic ring to avoid deformation. BEST-IN-CLASS and 60-DAYS RETURN: If you are not satisfied with our products, please kindly let us know, We are offering a 60-days return.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pZcfIltOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AZHCHKE","source_asin":"B09D3YQBTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3YQBTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3YQBTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832386,"name":"La Pastiche overstockArt Boreas Framed Oil Reproduction of an Original Painting by John William Waterhouse, Burgeon Gold Frame, Organic Pattern Facade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bEdxYFTFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description 20\" X 24\" Oil Painting On Canvas Waterhouse's Boreas 1903, represents the purple-winged god of the north in Greek mythology through symbolic storytelling. He places his beautiful subject at the forefront of the painting and celebrates her beauty with dark hair and porcelain skin. With a penchant for sad, despairing heroines, Waterhouse endows her with an expression of melancholy. Symbolizing the god of the north wind, the artist creates movement in the subject's garments by contrasting light and dark to create the draping and billowing of the fabric by the strong wind. Her garment reflects the heathery shades of violet symbolized by the god's purple wings according to the myth. This Waterhouse masterpiece will bring a sense of dramatic energy to any room in which it adorns, and will be the conversation piece for years to come. John William Waterhouse (born between January and April 1849, died February 10, 1917) was an English painter known mainly for his Pre-Raphaelite painting style. The artist drew inspiration from Romantic and Classical disciplines, as he developed a hybridization of these techniques over his lifetime to create some of the most hauntingly beautiful and enduring works of art. Frame Description: Burgeon Gold Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bEdxYFTFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"overstockArt","source_asin":"B00FNL19JC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FNL19JC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FNL19JC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
