window.products.push({"id":832471,"name":"Glass Of Venice Murano Glass Christmas Ornament Multicolor Mosaic Millefiori and Silver. Blown Glass Christmas Ornament for Holiday Decor, Italian Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717v0dn-f0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC ITALIAN HANDMADE: High-quality authentic ITALIAN MURANO GLASS Christmas Tree bauble ornament handmade in Venice, Italy. Multicolor millefiori inclusions with silver leaf. Our Christmas ornaments make a fine Italian gift for everyone. UNIQUE: Each Murano Glass Mosaic bauble is crafted entirely by hand using ancient glass-making techniques invented in Venice. The designs vary; the silver leaf is not infused evenly due to hand blowing; no two of these ornaments will be exactly the same. MEASUREMENTS: Diameter approximately 4\". SPECIFICATIONS: Fine blown Murano Glass ornament, hollow inside. Handmade by Italian artisans in Murano, Italy. Infused .925 silver leaf. This Italian Christmas bauble with Murano Glass Millefiori represents the world's finest art glass and traditional European holiday decor. ITALIAN CRAFTSMANSHIP: These Murano Glass Christmas balls are MADE IN ITALY, with the highest quality materials and craftsmanship. Sticker and Certificate of Authenticity included. Authentic handmade Murano Glass. Imported directly from the artisans in Italy by Glass Of Venice - the world's top importers and distributors of authentic Murano Glass. We stand fully by the quality and authenticity of all our Murano Glass ornaments, Christmas decor, and other Italian glassware. PERFECT GIFT: This Italian blown glass Christmas ball ornament is perfect for holiday decor. Our Murano Glass Christmas sculptures and ornaments make the perfect Italian gifts for everyone on your list. This holiday gift from Venice will instantly become a treasured family keepsake that will be proudly displayed every holiday season. OFFICIAL STORE: Imported and distributed by Glass Of Venice, the largest US-based provider of authentic Murano Glass. Since 2008 Glass Of Venice works directly with over 40 different Murano Glass factories, and workshops on Murano island in Venice, Italy. We are trusted by museums, galleries, art glass collectors, and interior designers to provide the widest range of the highest-quality museum-worthy authentic Murano Glass jewelry, tabletop, home decor, and other types of unique art glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717v0dn-f0L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glass Of Venice","source_asin":"B00E7ICJMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E7ICJMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E7ICJMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
