window.products.push({"id":832477,"name":"Masio 2.5 Quart Red Whistling Tea Kettle for Stove Top, Food Grade Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PE-seR54L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEET HOUSEHOLD NEEDS: The tea kettle for stove top with retro, fashionable and high-end appearance is a beautiful decoration for your kitchen. It can be placed on any heat source, such as gas, other stove, and induction so on, and heated with small and medium flames, which can saving energy. A large capacity can meet the needs of the whole family. FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL：Our tea kettle for stove top is made of high quality stainless steel, anti-rust, anti-corrosion, heat-resistant, achieving the food grade safety standard. The encapsulated base with three layers adopting high-sensitivity thermally conductive metal can enhance heating performance, maximizes heat conduction and minimizes heating time. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Our ergonomic handle allows you to hold the kettle firmly without dropping your hands and lift it easily, which is heat-resistant and anti-scalding. The pressing design at the handle controls the opening and closing of the spout to avoid burns, giving you maximum control over the flow of water and how slowly it is poured out. Enjoy the comfort of pouring and filling! MELODIOUS WHISTLE: The loud whistle will remind you that the water is boiled, so that you don’t have to concentrate on waiting for the water to boil and can do other works in the room or living room. Do not overfill kettle as well as fill no higher than just spout and the water line, so as not to disturb the whistle. ENSURE YOUR QUALITY LIFE: The outer layer of our kettle is high temperature resistant paint, which will not fade easily and is washable. And simultaneously the removable lid makes it easy to keep the inside clean. It will be the same as new after cleaning. Our product is free of Teflon and BPA, ensuring your quality of drinking water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PE-seR54L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"masio","source_asin":"B098N487B3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098N487B3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098N487B3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
