window.products.push({"id":832543,"name":"Carbon Fiber Coasters Set of 2 by Centri Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ng83MGw3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Centri Designs developed the carbon fiber coasters with your needs in mind. This material is perfect for exceeding anything you have seen before. Weighing as much as pencil, these coasters are incredibly strong and nearly unbendable . These unique coasters are only 1mm thick (thickness of a dime), yet 5 times stronger than steel and 40% lighter than aluminum. How? Each row of the 3K twill is a bundle of 3,000 individual carbon fibers, each of which measuring at only 1/20th the width of a human hair. Layers of the woven fibers are laid one atop another and then infused with epoxy resin and cured. The result is one of the strongest, most durable substances known to man. The carbon fiber coasters are an essential for the modern home. These look amazing on any type of surface. The coasters feature a matte finish on both sides to provide a beautifully silky look and scratch resistance. The cool look creates the perfect conversation starter and accent to your home or office. One of the distinctive properties of 3K twill carbon fiber is its iridescent, almost holographic, shine. And whether you're using it at work or at home, the head-turning look creates the perfect conversation starter. Carbon fiber is an unrivaled material for extreme sports, aerospace, and military that you can now carry wherever life takes you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ng83MGw3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Centri Designs","source_asin":"B017I6XD8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017I6XD8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017I6XD8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
