window.products.push({"id":832600,"name":"AKUSAKO Oil Filled Radiator Heater, 700W Portable Electric Radiant Heater with Thermostat, Super Quiet Oil Heaters, Overheat Protection, Portable Oil ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mVQ85tpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀【Oil Filled Heater - Must-Have for Winter】: Our oil space heaters have a thermostat control Knob and a heating mode that turns on 700W, keeping you warm in the cold winter and improving your quality of life. For the upcoming halloween, christmas, thanksgiving, valentine's day, holidays, the oil heater will be amazing gifts, bringing you warmth and love. ☀【Energy Saving & Efficient Heating】: The oil radiator heater has 7 oil-filled sinks and a powerful tubular element heating system that warms your room quickly and evenly without smoke and unpleasant odors, helping to save money on your electric bill, while the heat transfer oil exists permanently, saving you the expense of replacing your heater every year. ☀【Quiet & Comfortable】: Our oil heaters for indoor use work without the noise of a fan and will not disturb your sleep, work or thinking. The oil heater radiator heats the whole house by air circulation, it also provides longer lasting warmth, keeping the space warm and comfortable while allowing you to enjoy a quiet environment. ☀【Portable Oil Radiator Heater】: The oil space heater has a compact design, measuring 16\" x 12\" x 6\", with two bases and a portable handle, you can move it from one room to another quietly and effortlessly. ☀【Overheat Protection】: This oil filled heater has overheat protection, when the heater internal heating to a certain temperature will automatically cut off the power, to avoid a variety of potential hazards, is the ideal winter companion for your office and home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mVQ85tpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKUSAKO","source_asin":"B0BFDKH4CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFDKH4CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFDKH4CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
