window.products.push({"id":832602,"name":"NOVICA Leaf and Tree Large Steel Wall Mural, Brown 'Tule Tree'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SUMKxQBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Depicted in silhouette, a majestic tree comes to life as a wall sculpture. It recalls the famous tule tree in Santa Maria del Tule, Oaxaca. The venerable ahuehuete cypress is one of the oldest living trees in the world. Alejandro de Esesarte works in steel, cutting, shaping and painting it by hand.  Because each piece is individually hand-crafted and painted, size and color could vary slightly.  - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly   About our Artist: 'From the time I was a boy, I was attracted to art,' recalls Alejandro de Esesarte. 'When I was 20, I became an ecologist and defender of nature, and this is when I began to create animals in metal. My technique is similar to cutout metal, but more rudimentary. From this, I became inspired and started working in metal for its versatility. Today I have a workshop, a cockatoo named Coco and a cactus collection. Those are all the tools I need to continue working.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SUMKxQBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0082CKGI4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082CKGI4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082CKGI4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832603,"name":"FurFinds Annkey Non-Stick Tart Pan 10.63 inch Quiche Pan with Removable Loose Bottom Pie Pans Round Pizza Tart Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P1UwAUERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOTE: ANY QUALITY PROBLEM OF THE PRODUCT, PLEASE BE FREE TO CONTACT US FIRST, WE ARE ALWAYS HERE ASSISTING YOU. Annkey Tart Pan Pie Pans Nonstick with Removable Bottom, Removable Loose Bottom Quiche Pan 10.63inch If you want to make pretty pies, this pan is for you! It is well-made, finish with carbon steel, sturdy, and a perfect size. Comes apart and you end up with a ring and a flat disc. Fast heat transfer, even heat distribution. Non-stick coating for quick release the food, cleans up in an instant. Great for make tart, pie, pizza, cheese cakes, chocolate cakes, quiche, chocolate raspberry tart, French-style apple pie, peach tarts, cauliflower tart, an onion tart, and a strawberry tart with creme patisierre. This quiche pan-a great investment and makes you want to cook with it every day! Tips for place the tart: 1. Unroll a refrigerated pie crust and place it in the pan. 2. Start in the middle. If you start from the edges, it may tear the crust up on the pan edges. 3. 10.63inch round pan—Just the right size with a just a little left over to ornately fold over to make a slightly thicker crust edge. 4. Be careful handling the pan to prevent popping your pie out as the middle easily pops up. You can place it on a cookie sheet to fill and bake. 5. Once cooled, the pie comes right out, slides right off the non-stick bottom & onto your serving plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P1UwAUERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FurFinds","source_asin":"B07VZFQ7BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VZFQ7BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VZFQ7BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
