window.products.push({"id":832705,"name":"WOKA Ergonomic Kneeling Chair with Comfortable Cushion, Rocking Kneeling Chair for Home, Office and Meditation, Ergonomic Sitting Posture Chair, Rocki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lpu5tBMOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relieve Neck and Back Pain - In line with ergonomics. Unique retro design with riding style, the posture chair features maximum comfort to your back, knees and shins. With our kneeling seat cushion angled at a comfortable degree, the ergonomic kneeling chair effectively relieves back pain, neck strain and greatly reduces muscle fatigue. High quality Kneeling Chair - This rocking kneeling chair is made of high-quality sturdy birch material and it holds up to 265 lbs of weight. The thickened cushions will keep your knees and buttocks much comfortable and ensure all-day cool comfort. The knee chair can replace any traditional one, with the added plus of health benefits you can actually feel. Posture Corrective - Design to correct posture, prevent kyphosis and build beautiful body shape. This kneeling office chair has a functional design that encourages better posture. The chair for posture will keep your back at an upright position, distributing your weight evenly throughout your buttocks and legs, all while keeping your spine aligned, so that achieve the goal of correcting hunchback and bad posture. Wide Use- The ergonomic office chair kneeling is not just for back pain-relieving but posture correcting and suitable for meditation. Great for computer work or gaming, musing, reading, typing, sewing, crafting, and so on. You can use this kneel chair as a desk chair, a meditation chair, a home office chair, a posture correcting chair and more. So give your whole body a little wiggle room. Simplified Assembly: To make assembling this knee stool as effortless as possible, we have included clear and detailed instructions, numbered parts, and included all necessary tools. Feel free to reach to our customer service if you have any concerns with it, your satisfaction is our priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lpu5tBMOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOKA","source_asin":"B09HC7Q2V7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HC7Q2V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HC7Q2V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832706,"name":"Nearly Natural 4ft. Schefflera (Real Touch) Silk Tree, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wYaIi4iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Think Green, no matter what the weather is outside. That’s how you’ll feel when you gaze upon this stunning schefflera tree. With a stout trunk that projects an aura of strength, This tree makes the perfect piece to adorn an entranceway. The trunk gives way to a burst of lush Green and yellow leaves that feel every bit as real as they look, with nary a drop of water! Silk floral arrangements are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item may need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your tree will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wYaIi4iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B007WOJ1U2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007WOJ1U2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007WOJ1U2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832707,"name":"Walldecor1 Stainless Steel Contact Paper for Dishwasher Appliances Refrigerator Oven Fridge, Metal Covering Self Adhesive Shelf Drawer Liner, Dishwash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZ2hCqf7L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Redecorating your dishwasher, refrigerator, oven and fridge etc Just need purchase one roll contact paper, then stick the contact paper to flat place you want, it can make them looks like new one. Instruction for Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet, drawer, walls, window, glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is better. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZ2hCqf7L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walldecor1","source_asin":"B07FM5LYFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FM5LYFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FM5LYFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
