window.products.push({"id":832722,"name":"Authentic Solid Copper Moscow Mule Mug - 16 oz Large Pint - Set of One - Multi-Set Discounts - Perfect Summer Cocktails, Great Beer Mug or Camping Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cx-YV-xzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"\"Cups were raised, the men counted five and down went the first taste. It was good. It lifted the spirit to adventure.\" -- New York Herald Tribune, July 28, 1948 (on the invention of the Moscow Mule) Your New Favorite Mug...For Your Next Adventure There’s something about your favorite mug. You drink out of it every day. It’s the one you grab right out of cabinet in the morning. The one you throw in your pack when hitting the road. The one that is timeless, classic, and you remember exactly when and where you got it or the person that gave it to you. We set out to build that mug for you.  Oscar’s Hook Copper Mugs were born out of necessity. We bought the copper plated kind, but they would just end up looking terrible after a few uses. Where were the copper mugs from back in the 40s and 50s? The ones that were indestructible? We couldn’t find one. So we decided to make one. Crafted from 250 grams of solid copper, we set out to bring you a mug that would become your new favorite. That would last a lifetime. That you could pass on.  We hope you enjoy. Cleaning: Handwash only, with soap and water. Shining: Oscar's Hook Copper Mugs come without laquer, meaning they will begin to patina quickly. To shine, rub gently with lemon juice and sea salt mix. Lifetime Warranty & 100% Money Back Guarantee. At Oscar’s Hook, we stand behind the superior quality and craftsmanship of our products. That’s why we guarantee each item for life. If, for whatever reason, you don’t absolutely love your Oscar’s Hook Copper Mug, just return it, and we’ll refund every penny. Click \"Add to Cart\" to enjoy your premium Solid Copper Moscow Mule Mug!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cx-YV-xzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oscar's Hook","source_asin":"B00U1XZT3E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U1XZT3E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U1XZT3E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":832723,"name":"Diva At Home 22� Snow White Tuxedo Pleated Decorative Throw Pillow - Poly Filled","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwwguRfRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color: bright white Pillow with a pleated decorative accent and a subtle shine Washing Instructions: spot clean or dry clean Dimensions: 22\"H x 22\"W Material(s): Shell: polyester Filling: polyester A portion of the profits from these rugs and pillows goes towards a school lunch program that serves fresh, nutritious daily meals to 1.3 million children in rural India. For many children, this is their only substantial meal of the day. Additional donations are also made to a scholarship program that enhances literacy and learning in Southeast Asia. Nearly 80 percent of children from impoverished families drop out before graduation due to the burden of educational fees, books and uniforms. This program helps compensate for all school expenses in addition to mandating and paying for after-school tutoring for students most in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwwguRfRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diva At Home","source_asin":"B007XEYFC0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007XEYFC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007XEYFC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
