window.products.push({"id":832725,"name":"Deluxe Digital Instant Read Meat Thermometer - Waterproof Kitchen Food Cooking Thermometer with Backlight LCD - Best Super Fast Electric Meat Thermome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410hna68+lL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features: 1). Clear digital screen ,easy to readout the readings. 2). This digital thermometer is waterproof (IPX4), it provides protection against solids and water. 3). Wide measuring range (-49~482℉), perfect for grilling, hot oil, home-make dessert, candy, deep fry food, etc. 4). 4.7\" Super Long stainless steel probe. Perfect for huge turkey, chicken, roast leg of lamb, bread making, hot water, hot milk, and even bath water. No more hands' burning 5). Data Hold function . The HOLD feature can lock in temperatures for safer and easier readings. 6). Resolution: 0.1 ℃/ ºF . Temperature accuracy: ±2ºF(±1℃) in range between 32 to 212ºF (0 to 100℃) Operations： 1). Temperature measuring and button functions:  a. Press“ON/OFF”to turn on the unit, LCD will display the current environment temperature b. Insert the probe into drinks or food to obtain the temperature. Read the temperature when the temperature reading on LCD becomes stable. Clean or disinfect the probe after use. c. Press“ON/OFF”to turn off the unit after use. The unit will power off automatically if there has no operations for 15mins. d. HOLD function: Press HOLD button to hold the current reading. Press again to unhold. 2). Battery replacement：  The user needs to replace the battery when LCD becomes dim. Unscrew the battery compartment to take out the used battery, and reinstall a new LR44 battery with correct polarity. Notes： 1). Clean or disinfect the probe before and after use 2). The unit may not work properly under strong magnetic interference. When this happens, reinstall the battery and get away from such environment.  3). When the unit doesn't work properly, reinstall the battery and the unit will work fine.  4). NEVER use the digital thermometer in a closed oven","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410hna68+lL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PREVE","source_asin":"B074P69ZGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074P69ZGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074P69ZGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
