window.products.push({"id":832910,"name":"HOME-X Blue Kitchen Scale, Small Mechanical Scale for Weighing Food Portions up to 35 oz, Analogue, Simple to Use, No Battery- 6” H x 4.5” W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713xQcFoA0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Some recipes require ultimate precision. Instead of relying on measuring cups, you may be asked to measure in ounces or precise measurements. To get your ingredient amounts correct, you can rely on this HOME-X Blue Kitchen Scale. It measures ounces, but you can use it for both liquid and solid ingredients. The scale can also be used to create perfect portion sizes. Our scale is made from polystyrene plastic and features a blue ABS plastic shell. The bright blue color will add a splash of color to your kitchen when cooking or baking. To use the scale, adjust the scale to read 0 ounces by turning the small black wheel on the back, when the dish is on the weighing platform. Then, simply add your ingredients or food to the dish. The black and white analog display can help you get a clear reading. This scale is mechanical, so it relies on a spring inside the device. Therefore, the scale doesn't require a power outlet or batteries, so you can use it whenever and wherever you need it. When you're done with the scale, you can wash the weighing dish by hand and let air dry. Our kitchen scale is designed to be portable and lightweight. The frame of the scale measures 4 1/4\" L x 4 1/2\" W x 6\" H, and the dish is removable for easy storage. This scale can help you maintain a balanced diet or get the precision you need in complex recipes. It also makes a great gift for friends or family members who enjoy spending time in the kitchen. Order your HOME-X Blue Kitchen Scale today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713xQcFoA0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08FCPX6HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-832910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FCPX6HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FCPX6HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
